    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78375" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραλῡπέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>grieve</i> or <i>trouble besides</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλο παρελύπει . . οὐδέν</span> no disease
				<i>attacked</i> them <i>besides</i> the plague, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.51
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Vect.</u>
				4.32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				1.7.8
			</span></i> ; <i>annoy by a diversion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.89
